。データが取得でき次第、ここに自動で表示されます。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"76.0\" width=\"320\" height=\"21.200000000000003\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,21.5 9.1,19.3 14.2,12.8 19.3,18.8 24.5,20.9 29.6,16.0 34.7,13.3 39.8,21.5 44.9,24.2 50.0,14.9 55.1,17.7 60.3,16.6 65.4,18.2 70.5,23.7 75.6,26.9 80.7,21.5 85.8,20.4 91.0,24.2 96.1,24.2 101.2,28.0 106.3,29.1 111.4,23.7 116.5,23.7 121.6,34.6 126.8,41.6 131.9,42.2 137.0,42.7 142.1,37.8 147.2,43.8 152.3,44.9 157.4,48.7 162.6,56.4 167.7,58.5 172.8,66.7 177.9,65.1 183.0,75.4 188.1,73.3 193.2,77.6 198.4,54.2 203.5,41.1 208.6,36.2 213.7,16.0 218.8,31.3 223.9,30.2 229.0,31.3 234.2,40.0 239.3,36.7 244.4,34.6 249.5,27.5 254.6,25.3 259.7,34.6 264.9,34.6 270.0,33.5 275.1,31.3 280.2,46.0 285.3,48.2 290.4,59.6 295.5,58.5 300.7,59.1 305.8,60.7 310.9,46.6 316.0,34.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 33.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 33.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 33.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 33.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 33.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 33.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M